  "Description":      "Text to Speech: converts a Text Object (Basic Text Object or Text Object) into a Speech Object (Basic Speech Object or Speech Object). Its input port accepts both OSD-BTO and OSD-TXO; its output port carries both OSD-BSO and OSD-SPO, so a consumer that wants either the basic or the full object finds it. Within MMC-AMQ-V2.5 and MMC-TST-V2.5 its Output Speech goes to the User Agent across the Composite AIM boundary: Speech Object Delivery is a User Agent module there, not a SubAIM.",

